  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cobblemon-advancement-plaques\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fcobblemon-advancement-plaques\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/N8tUm6N4Qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord-plural\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Kesselspacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"youtube-plural\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkesselot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular-alt_vector.svg\" alt=\"kofi-singular-alt\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/documentation/website_vector.svg\" alt=\"website\"></a></p><h1>總覽</h1><p>如果你熱愛Cobblemon模組，並想將那些枯燥的舊成就換成更有趣的內容，請使用這個Cobblemon成就銘牌資源包。將預設的成就訊息轉變為Cobblemon主題的成就。</p><h1>重要事項</h1><ol>\n<li>此資源包需要<strong>Advancement Plaques Mod</strong>才能正常運作。</li>\n</ol><h2><a href=\"https://discord.gg/N8tUm6N4Qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">資源包Discord</a></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/39e1d151-f787-4346-9014-f14dc996f94e.webp\" alt=\"Banner Bisecthosting\"></a></p><h3>資源包注意事項</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>如果你是使用此資源包的YouTuber或內容創作者，請在描述中加入此頁面的連結，讓觀眾知道你使用的資源包來源。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>禁止在Modrinth或CurseForge上重新上傳此資源包或任何修改版本，亦禁止轉載至其他網站。</strong>（<em>除非獲得本人明確許可</em>）</li>\n</ul>",
